[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-PAGE-OUTLET
TITLE: Page Outlet

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-10
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL render the active Member Frontend page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Member Frontend pages mount through the Page Outlet so each page shares the App Root shell. Page contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-11
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL sit between the Header host and the Footer host and SHALL grow to fill the remaining App Root space.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placing the outlet between the hosts and letting it grow keeps Header and Footer at the edges while page content uses the middle of the shell as the viewport resizes.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-12
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Page Outlet is a mount for page contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so pages share the shell defaults until a page sets its own presentation. Independent Page Outlet colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-79
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-13
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-APP-ROOT-CHROME-GATE
TITLE: Authenticated Chrome Gate

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-32
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When the member is not logged in, the GSSC Website Member Frontend App Root SHALL omit the Header host and the Footer host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Authenticated Member Frontend views share Header and Footer. Logged-out states, including the login experience, must not show that authenticated chrome.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-100
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
