REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-60
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-30
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Login control SHALL appear among the Header account-access controls when no member is logged in, and SHALL be omitted when a member is logged in.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Login replaces Greeting and Logout when there is no session. Omitting it when logged in avoids offering login to an authenticated member.
<<<
