TITLE: Resources Next

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-117
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Resources Next control SHALL move the Section Resources carousel one step toward later resources when activated, wrapping from the last resource to the first.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Next steps the looping strip forward so every resource stays reachable from the ends of the strip.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
