Pairing Cancel with Save in one action row keeps discard and commit discoverable together.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-84
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-MHLR-24
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-191
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Editor Cancel Control SHALL use the white theme token for its background, the dark-green theme token for its border and label, a sans-serif typeface, and the label Cancel.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
White fill distinguishes discard from the light-green Save control.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
