[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-211
TITLE: Directory Authentication
STATEMENT: >>>
The Member Frontend SHALL open the Directory Page only for a logged-in member and SHALL redirect a logged-out visitor who requests the directory to the Login Page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The members directory is authenticated content; route guards keep logged-out visitors on login.
<<<
