[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-MLLR-212
TITLE: Directory Load And Filter
STATEMENT: >>>
When the Directory Page opens with empty search criteria, the Member Frontend SHALL load the unfiltered members list from the Unified Backend, and when the viewer searches with one or more criteria, the Member Frontend SHALL reload the list using those criteria as Unified Backend query filters.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Empty criteria show the full collaboration or registered list; filled criteria narrow it through the existing users list API.
<<<
